      "title": "Box or Music",
      "season": 1,
      "episode": 1,
      "number": 1,
      "released": "2022-08-29T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "In the first episode of the series, we meet the protagonist, 19-year-old Alyosha, who, according to the wishes of his father Vellia, once a great boxer and owner of a boxing club, himself trains boxing and is preparing to enroll in the DIF. Still, Alyosha's real passion is making music. And Alyosha's girlfriend, Thea, is torn between her parents' ambitions and her own desires.",
