      "overview": "The second episode of the series \"In the clinch\" introduces us to further problems in Velja's house - after Velja drove his son out of the house in a fit of rage due to Alyosha's passing the entrance exam for audio studies, Mira's mother tries to smooth out the situation in the family.",
